{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce an AI automation tax on companies that replace human workers with AI",
        "additional_details": "We ask the UK Government to introduce an AI automation tax based on companies based on their turnover and the number of human employees replaced by AI. We feel businesses that use AI to eliminate jobs should pay higher taxes to discourage job losses and help replace lost income tax and National Insurance contributions. The new revenue should fund social welfare, public services and people affected by automation, ensuring companies contribute fairly when technology replaces human labour.",
        "background": "Introduce an AI automation on companies, based on their turnover, which uses AI to replace human workers. We believe companies replacing people with AI should pay more tax to discourage job losses, compensate for lost income tax and National insurance, and to fund social welfare and public services.",
